Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.52,0:00:26.45,Note,,0,0,0,,They just finished watching the story Episode 8
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.52,0:00:17.46,Ena,,0,0,0,,And so with that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:21.75,Ena,,0,0,0,,for this episode, instead of talking over it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:26.45,Ena,,0,0,0,,we just wanted to give it our undivided attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.30,0:00:24.68,Mizuki,,0,0,0,,Yep
